Evaluation protocol source
  Generative-perplexity reference scoring follows the MDLM codebase protocol
  (https://github.com/sahil280114/code-align-mdlm); ROUGE via rouge_score with
  stemming, sacrebleu for BLEU — as configured upstream.

Risk note (accepted, documented)
  Checkpoints load with torch.load(weights_only=False) and eval shards are pickles —
  both execute attacker-controlled code if provenance is broken. We downloaded only
  from the official hazyresearch org over HTTPS, pinned file sizes against the HF
  API, and record sha256 of every artifact used. Re-verify with
  `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS` before trusting our numbers.
